		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour, <br />j&#039;ai essayé de mettre en oeuvre les bloom filters. j&#039;ai suivi le lien : <a href="http://blog.coelho.net/database/2016/12/11/postgresql-bloom-index.html" rel="nofollow">http://blog.coelho.net/database/2016/12 … index.html</a></p><p>j&#039;ai crée une table foo avec 100 millions de lignes<br />un index bloom, mais quoi que je fasse, je passe toujours en seq scan.<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;Table Â« public.foo Â»<br /> Colonne |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Type&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Modificateurs<br />---------+-----------------------------+------------------------------------------------------<br /> id&#160; &#160; &#160; | integer&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| non NULL Par dÃ©faut, nextval(&#039;foo_id_seq&#039;::regclass)<br /> c1&#160; &#160; &#160; | integer&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|<br /> c2&#160; &#160; &#160; | integer&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|<br /> c3&#160; &#160; &#160; | integer&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|<br /> c4&#160; &#160; &#160; | integer&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|<br /> c5&#160; &#160; &#160; | integer&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|<br /> it&#160; &#160; &#160; | timestamp without time zone | non NULL Par dÃ©faut, now()<br />Index :<br />&#160; &#160; &quot;foo_c1c2c3c4c5&quot; bloom (c1, c2, c3, c4, c5) WITH (length=&#039;64&#039;, col1=&#039;3&#039;, col2=&#039;3&#039;, col3=&#039;3&#039;, col4=&#039;3&#039;, col5=&#039;3&#039;)</p><p>idev00=&gt; explain select * from foo where c1=463274 and c2=459458 and c3=291859 and c4=198159;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; QUERY PLAN<br />---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> Gather&#160; (cost=1000.00..1042428.67 rows=1 width=32)<br />&#160; &#160;Workers Planned: 7<br />&#160; &#160;-&gt;&#160; Parallel Seq Scan on foo&#160; (cost=0.00..1041428.57 rows=1 width=32)<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;Filter: ((c1 = 463274) AND (c2 = 459458) AND (c3 = 291859) AND (c4 = 198159))<br />(4 lignes)</p><p> Quelqu&#039;un aurait une idée ?</p><p>merci</p>]]></content>
